menu "BMDS network"

    config BMDS_NET_PRIORITY
        int "Ethernet device task priority"
        default 21
        range 1 24
        help
            The task of each Ethernet device (devplan/network.md §4): it takes the frames the
            DMA has received, reclaims sent ones and checks the link. Above the audio engine,
            so real-time frames (PTP, AES67) reach their consumers without waiting for it.

    config BMDS_NET_STACK_PRIORITY
        int "IP stack task priority"
        default 6
        range 1 24
        help
            The network task (devplan/network.md §15): it gives received frames to lwIP and
            runs lwIP's timers. Above the window manager, so the network keeps up while the
            screen is busy; below audio, which bulk traffic must never hold up.

endmenu
